[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Unscrew the bolt.</p><p>2. Gently extract the switch unit and control unit.</p><p>3. Disconnect the electrical connections (3a, 3b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3a</p></td><td><p>Electric window controls on front door</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024136\">H44A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3b</p></td><td><p>Electric window controls on front door</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024137\">H44B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>4. Recover the switch unit and control unit.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005148.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the switch unit\nand control unit is not damaged.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p>Fit the switch unit and control unit in\nposition.</p><p>Tighten the bolt.</p><p>Check that the switches are working properly.</p>"]]